{{Spell}}

==Details==
Grants Mana equal to:

<math>N \times E \times 80</math>

Grants [[:Category:Spells#Spell_Shards|Spell Shards]] equal to:

<math>(L \times 4 + 100) \times E^{0.075}</math>
<br>(maximum 1e12). Cannot grant shards to itself.

where:
* <math>N = \text{Mana per Sec}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Character Level}</math>
* <math>E = \text{Evocation Efficiency}</math>